een Code|screen-avoid-premature-abstraction\",\n      \"R19|Extract Route-local Section Components Only for Runtime Boundaries|screen-extract-local-section-components-for-runtime-boundaries\",\n      \"R20|Extract Screen Support Code Only When the Boundary Is Real|screen-extract-utilities-selectively\",\n      \"R21|Keep Derived Values Close to Where They Are Used|screen-keep-derived-values-close\",\n      \"R22|Keep Route Entry Files Focused on Screen Flow|screen-keep-route-flow-visible\",\n      \"R23|Move Screen-owned Pure Support Code Into page.ts Before Splitting Further|screen-move-pure-support-code-out-of-entry-files\",\n      \"R24|Keep Screen-specific Handler Flow Local Until a Real Utility Emerges|events-keep-handler-flow-inline\",\n      \"R25|Name Handlers Predictably and Curry Extra Arguments|events-name-and-curry-handlers\",\n      \"R26|Run User Actions in Handlers, Not Effects|events-run-user-actions-in-handlers-not-effects\",\n      \"R27|Avoid Silent Fallback Defaults and Ad-hoc Loading Branches|state-avoid-fallback-defaults-and-loading-flags\",\n      \"R28|Calculate Derived Values During Rendering|state-calculate-derived-values-during-render\",\n      \"R29|Choose State Tools by Source of Truth|state-choose-state-tools-by-source-of-truth\",\n      \"R30|Name Query and Mutation Bindings Consistently|state-name-query-and-mutation-bindings-consistently\",\n      \"R31|Prefer React Compiler Defaults Over Manual Memoization|state-compiler-first-memoization\",\n      \"R32|Preserve Response and Store Origin in Wide Scopes|state-preserve-origin-chaining\",\n      \"R33|Shape React Query Data in query.select|state-shape-query-data-with-select\",\n      \"R34|Store Shared Derived Decisions Only When They Are Truly Shared|state-store-derived-authority\",\n      \"R35|Use Functional setState Updates When Based on Previous State|state-use-functional-setstate-updates\",\n      \"R36|Use Lazy State Initializers for Expensive Defaults|state-use-lazy-state-initializers-for-expensive-defaults\",\n      \"R37|Use startTransition for Non-urgent Visual Updates|state-use-starttransition-for-non-urgent-updates\",\n      \"R38|Use useDeferredValue for Heavy Derived Renders|state-use-usedeferredvalue-for-heavy-derived-renders\",\n      \"R39|Use useEffectEvent for Non-reactive Effect Callbacks|state-use-effectevent-for-non-reactive-effect-callbacks\",\n      \"R40|Document Compound Parts with @part and @description|docs-document-compound-parts-with-part-and-description\",\n      \"R41|Limit Inline Comments to Non-obvious Logic|docs-limit-inline-comments-to-non-obvious-logic\",\n      \"R42|Require JSDoc on React Hooks, Handlers, and Key Declarations|docs-require-jsdoc-on-key-declarations\"\n    ],\n    \"typescript\": [\n      \"T01|Centralize Shared Config Under shared/config.ts|naming-centralize-shared-config-namespaces\",\n      \"T02|Preserve Shared Namespace Origin With Chained Access|naming-preserve-config-origin-with-chained-access\",\n      \"T03|Use Consistent File, Symbol, and Field Naming|naming-use-consistent-file-and-symbol-naming\",\n      \"T04|Use Direct Imports and Dedicated Public Entry Points|naming-use-direct-imports-and-public-entry-points\",\n      \"T05|Document Custom Types and Declarative Shapes|types-document-custom-types-and-shapes\",\n      \"T06|Mark Unused Parameters With an Underscore Prefix|types-mark-unused-parameters-with-underscore\",\n      \"T07|Prefer Function Variable Types Over Parameter Annotations|types-prefer-function-variable-types-over-parameter-annotations\",\n      \"T08|Reuse Callback Signatures From Existing Contracts|types-reuse-callback-signatures-from-existing-contracts\",\n      \"T09|Reuse Existing Contracts Before Declaring New Types|types-reuse-existing-contracts-before-new-types\",\n      \"T10|Avoid Imperative Assembly in Wide Scopes|functions-avoid-imperative-assembly-in-wide-scopes\",\n      \"T11|Extract Support Functions Only When the Boundary Is Real|functions-extract-